WEBVTT

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:21.450
<b>Muhyo & Roji's
Bureau of Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:35.190
The one who looks like you now...

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:38.570
is Sophie, isn't it?

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:42.450
Wait!

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:52.590
<b>Article 9 
Sophie</b>

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:55.090
We have to hurry outside!

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:59.130
I'm sure there was a boat under the pier!

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:02.910
We'll ride it out of here,

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:04.850
then we'll live together!

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:07.020
I've seen enough of the sea,

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:09.480
so we'll live in a little 
house near the mountains!

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.930
A little house?

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:18.330
A cute house?

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:19.740
Yeah, of course!

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:23.740
I love cute houses.

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:28.000
Kusano-kun, what is your superior's name?

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:31.020
Muh—Uh, I mean...

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.250
Muhyo Toru?

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:36.070
The genius executor? Then he might...

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.480
And who are the other executors?

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:40.760
Uh, it's just Muhyo...

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.440
Just him?

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:48.330
Then it's going to be 
difficult to defeat Sophie.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:51.060
What? Even for Muhyo?

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:54.780
I-Is this Sophie really that powerful?

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:57.770
Then it's a wonder you got back here alive.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:59.450
I don't understand it myself.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.440
When I was dragged into the bathroom,

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:04.950
two hands grabbed my face.

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:09.500
Then, when I thought it was 
all over, I heard a voice...

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:15.430
You have bobbed hair, huh? 
Never mind. Don't want it!

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:19.980
Isn't Rio taking a bit long?

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.830
What did you say?

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:29.020
I already have a little house.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.520
I have to tell everyone!

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.770
Sophie is... Sophie is...

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:41.650
A small house...

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.650
About this size.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:52.840
So... never mind. Don't want it!

00:03:55.600 --> 00:04:00.170
Do you love this girl?

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:07.150
Then you'll have to get 
rid of this ugly face.

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:11.560
After all, it doesn't suit her.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:13.310
Wait!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:15.310
It's too dangerous for just 
the two of you to—

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.830
Ma'am! You shouldn't walk around alone!

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:30.950
Sophie is nearby!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.520
I'm too late...

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:40.100
Oh, this face...

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:43.340
is boring me.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.130
You're...

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.480
very pretty.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.150
Oh, yes. Before I become you...

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:08.100
I'll need to take off your face.

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:12.600
Iwamoto-san...

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.860
H-How could you?

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.480
Well, because...

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.000
I had to.

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:29.260
I just can't bear having 
two of the same face.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:36.020
Rio-sensei, where are you?!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.520
Roji-kun!

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.210
Thank goodness!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.030
How did you get hurt?

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:52.440
We're playing tag! How fun!

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:57.160
Wait, is that...

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:02.670
Want to play tag with us?

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:07.820
Roji-kun, write your name on these 
balls and throw them at Sophie!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.600
Hurry!

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.370
They're smoke bombs for use 
in battles against spirits.

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:27.360
They should slow her down a little.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.280
Ma'am, use this!

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:33.980
You can still pull just about anything  
out from that bag of yours, I see.

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:38.290
Rio-sensei!

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.890
She got me when I tried to run away.

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:44.860
There's a reason she's 
called the Face Ripper.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:46.840
All I did was try to run, and she did this.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.740
I'm sure Iwamoto-san and 
Furuya-san met the same fate.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.380
She's gonna turn into one of them?

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:56.260
Okay, right here should be fine.

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:00.700
I'll hold Sophie here.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:04.310
You two go smack Muhyo awake.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.320
B-But...

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:08.330
Well, you heard her.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.950
We're counting on you, Roji-kun.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.320
You're going with him!

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.820
No, I'm not!

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.400
All right. I'll wake him up.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:23.330
But in return, both of 
you have to stay safe!

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.020
Promise!

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.740
You're so stubborn.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.840
You could die. Is that what you want?

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:34.620
If I die with you, I couldn't ask for more.

00:07:37.170 --> 00:07:38.340
Of course...

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.560
I figured you'd say that.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:52.070
Found you!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.200
So Furuya-san is the one Sophie turned into?

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.630
Yes.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.110
Poor girl...

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:02.400
Muhyo! Muhyo, wake up!

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:04.400
The others are in trouble!

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:05.610
Muhyo!

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.490
What do we do? He won't wake up.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:10.260
We'll wake him up!

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:24.600
This should buy us some time...

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:32.890
<i>Her hand is shaking...</i>

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.380
Oh, dear.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.510
Which one could they be in?

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.370
Where have you gone?

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.670
Where are you?

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:56.680
M-Ma'am...

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.600
What, Bico?

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.610
Wrong one.

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.520
It's like a treasure hunt.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:18.970
I-I'm... a terrible student.

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:23.620
I got you involved in this...

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:26.620
This one?

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:34.130
Because of my seal, three people have...

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.330
I'm an awful magical tools master.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.640
This one!

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:41.450
You're wrong, Bico.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:48.660
Your talismans are perfect. 
You're a great magical tools master.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.650
Besides,

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:55.820
to me, you were a rainbow in the darkness.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.910
What? Darkness?

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.340
Bingo!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.380
Now!

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:22.250
Run, Bico!

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:25.360
Gotcha!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.230
M-Ma'am!

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:31.980
No!

00:10:32.390 --> 00:10:33.990
Don't!

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:36.380
Muhyo...

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.050
M-Muhyo...

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:49.830
Sophie!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:53.090
Get away from Rio-sensei!

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:55.090
Kusano!

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:56.570
You fool!

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:58.590
Judge Imai!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:00.590
Y-You're alive...

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:03.880
Rio-sensei, run! Now's your chance!

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.890
Why are you getting in my way?

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.400
Roji-kun!

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.870
Why?

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:24.700
In the name of Judge Imai Reiko...

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:30.960
I just want to be cute, too...

00:11:35.780 --> 00:11:39.050
I enforce the Art of Evil Spirit Expulsion!

00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:46.680
I'm so glad you're all right, Sensei.

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:50.760
Thanks, but that was a bit reckless.

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:52.040
Exactly.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:57.370
You and I are the only ones who 
can buy time while Muhyo-dono

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:59.190
enforces high-level magical law.

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.570
And my talisman won't hold her for long.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:07.360
There's no way to know if Muhyo-dono's 
contract with Hell will work.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.990
W-With Hell?

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:12.440
Yes. With an evil spirit of Sophie's power,

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:16.560
only high-level magical law that's many 
times more destructive than the basic stuff

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:17.750
has a chance of working.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:22.710
That's why he has to summon a 
higher-ranked messenger of Hell,

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:26.300
but that requires a contract with Hell.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.880
The words you hear Muhyo-dono reciting

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:32.650
are an incantation for 
communicating with Hell.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:38.040
That kind of contract with Hell usually 
takes several executors to complete...

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.080
And he's doing it on his own.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:47.340
But I'm sure Muhyo can—

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:51.040
Muhyo!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.020
You're soaked with sweat!

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:56.210
Shut up. Don't get in my way.

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:59.210
The incantation consumes an 
immense amount of strength.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:01.880
Why don't you take a break, Muhyo?

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:27.740
She's coming!

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:36.000
<b>The Devil's Shadow</b>

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:36.000
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.000
<b>Hell Train</b>

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:42.000
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:47.950
Not there...

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:48.760
Huh?

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.030
That's a trap.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.570
Art of Exorcism!

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:08.320
Kusano!

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:11.530
Art of Exorcism!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:13.910
It hit her?!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.950
Bico!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:37.100
Of the twenty years while 
you were sealed away,

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:40.230
two years were behind a sealing 
talisman that I made.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.360
If you want to kill someone, kill me!

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:54.780
She broke through the barrier in one hit...

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:56.910
Kusano, can you get up?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.060
Bico-san...

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:05.920
Please give me some of your talismans!

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.170
But mine are...

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.020
Thank you.

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.150
I have to protect Muhyo!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.460
Magic Binding Spell!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:39.410
D-Did it work?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.670
No way!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:44.670
It didn't work!

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:49.610
It's no use! There's nothing 
else I can do, Muhyo!

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:53.260
Well done. Your job is over, all of you.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:53.930
Huh?

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.410
What is this?

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:09.530
The contract is complete.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.320
Ch-Chains?

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:15.570
That's it?!

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:19.860
N-No! That proves that the 
contract is complete!

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.280
Does this mean the sentence is...

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:25.400
According to Magical Law Article 98,

00:16:25.400 --> 00:16:27.460
for the crime of "Becoming Someone Else"...

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.740
Fog's breaking out!

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:34.220
Reduce speed.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:36.040
Captain!

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:39.220
What's all the fuss? It's just a little fog.

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:41.870
There's a huge shadow on the radar!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.980
It's probably just a tanker or—

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:44.980
Wha...

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.980
What is that?!

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:51.430
I sentence you to "Hell's Marshal"!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:17:01.240
These stupid things! These stupid things!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.370
Those chains are amazing...

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:06.310
Even Sophie's power has no effect on them.

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:08.500
That's a given.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:12.760
Those chains are sent from Hell's 
lowest level to restrain criminals.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.940
They're the Chains of Tartarus!

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:19.500
They belong to Hell's Marshal,

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:21.380
the leader of Hell's Iron Soldiers!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:24.770
No good! It's gonna hit us!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.460
What are you doing?!

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.270
Sound the horn!

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:44.790
What... is that?

00:17:57.060 --> 00:18:01.550
Curses!

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:02.670
Watch out!

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:07.560
O-Of course! Sophie's telekinesis!

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:09.810
Stop!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:19.440
I'll take you with me.

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.480
Watch out, Bico!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:26.620
Physical Barrier Spell!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:33.430
Wh-What's wrong with you people?

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.890
I only want...

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:43.190
to be cute!

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:57.670
You just wanted to be cute, huh?

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:01.130
Well, sorry I ruined that for you.

00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:15.040
But it's over now.

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:40.950
Th-That gigantic sword just...

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:42.870
Right through Sophie...

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:49.340
Why, Onee-chan?

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:54.710
Congratulations on your 100th 
time staying home alone, Sophie.

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:58.090
Why can't I go to the party?

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:00.540
Why only you?

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.340
It's dangerous outside.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.780
This is to keep you safe.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:06.710
Okay...

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:09.860
I'm finished eating.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.060
That little brat!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:21.650
She wants to go to the 
party looking like <i>that</i>?

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:25.400
I'd disgrace this family by 
taking that ugly brat with me!

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:29.910
No!

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.400
Sophie!

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:38.170
Now can I go to the party?

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.660
She said, "Onee-chan."

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:50.770
I guess something happened that 
turned her into a spirit.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.690
Hmph. Maybe.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.900
Look!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.820
Hell's Marshal is leaving.

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:02.700
It's over!

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:04.950
You're pathetic.

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:06.810
Muhyo-dono.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:12.870
Now the souls of my subordinate, Fujiwara, 
and the jailers are vindicated.

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:15.080
Thank you.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.270
It's true, isn't it, Muhyo?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:22.860
Because of my talisman, three people are...

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:26.060
The moment they accepted their jobs here,

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:28.800
they also had to accept that 
things like this could happen.

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:31.840
If you stay depressed forever,

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:34.310
they'll never be able to rest in peace.

00:21:35.090 --> 00:21:36.900
<i>Three people died...</i>

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.900
<i>It really was a horrific battle.</i>

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:43.260
<i>If I could have used the talismans better...</i>

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:44.820
Wait.

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:51.870
Rio-sensei, I thought magical tools 
masters couldn't use magical tools.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:53.450
How did you...

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:55.030
What...

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:58.370
are you talking about?

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:34.400
Lord of Hell's Furnace, Black Fire Lizard...

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:38.690
Give the calamity of the forbidden 
flames unto my hands!

00:23:38.690 --> 00:23:43.060
Next time on <i>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau 
of Supernatural Investigation</i>,

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:44.890
Article 10:

00:23:45.410 --> 00:23:46.320
"Raspberries."

00:23:47.330 --> 00:23:50.680
Magical law will be enforced.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:54.950
<b>Article 10 
Raspberries</b>
